      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 D\u2019Agostino et al.",
        "AbstractText": "Herein, we report the draft genome sequence of Pseudomonas fluorescens strain CREA-C16, a plant growth-promoting rhizobacterium that was isolated from the rhizosphere of Pisum sativum L. plants. The genome sequence is ~6 Mb in size, with a G+C content of 60.1%, and includes 4,457 candidate protein-encoding genes."
      },
